at": ""}, {"path": "/@ZukeMacha/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/68e081c9/uploads/origins/bc20f66e-fec0-41a3-85e9-190adb1ed7e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c685f3ddc12aabe8c532c332f53b24c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68e081c9/uploads/origins/bc20f66e-fec0-41a3-85e9-190adb1ed7e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c685f3ddc12aabe8c532c332f53b24c, https://si.imgix.net/68e081c9/uploads/origins/bc20f66e-fec0-41a3-85e9-190adb1ed7e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bc3501ca1765bfac953a183731c08a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68e081c9/uploads/origins/bc20f66e-fec0-41a3-85e9-190adb1ed7e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eace5a1ca2bfd47e44a95949595e2362 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "某ゲームの自キャラクターのイラストをリクエストしたいです\n構図、表情等はおまかせします\nできれば水着が見える正面向きで\n頭から足のタトゥーあたり（膝上）までは描いて頂けると嬉しいです\nタトゥー全体の半分くらい見えていればOKです、デザインだけ個別で乗せておきます\n補足ですが水着のトップの下側についてるトゲみたいな部分、\n腰回りについてる平たい？よくわからないものと、手に持ってる武器は描かなくてもokです\nゲーム側で消せないのでお手数ですが修正して頂けると嬉しいです\n参考画像雑ですみませんがgyazoで失礼します\n上記の内容でよろしければリクエスト受けていだたけると嬉しいです\n\nhttps://gyazo.com/9241487cc5840433eb3acbc97d486b4a", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ZukeMacha/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eea6fb32/uploads/origins/08bd53e9-bc6c-4c78-aa37-de0f74130f61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fd031946443724854d455d0c60b4e8e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eea6fb32/uploads/origins/08bd53e9-bc6c-4c78-aa37-de0f74130f61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fd031946443724854d455d0c60b4e8e, https://si.imgix.net/eea6fb32/uploads/origins/08bd53e9-bc6c-4c78-aa37-de0f74130f61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34ed2cc0561c0b3883f908edb6de9615 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eea6fb32/uploads/origins/08bd53e9-bc6c-4c78-aa37-de0f74130f61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c287c70baf53f39a6359acd98d924a86 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. I really love your style, especially the way you draw eyes!\n\nCan you draw VTuber Iekushi Chapipi ( https://twitter.com/IekushiChapipi )? \n\nChapipi is a computer virus and a bit of a brat, but also gets flustered and embarrassed easily! She can also sing very well. She's very talented and tries to provide a lot of variety! This includes being cute sometimes, cool other times, and seductive when she wants to be.\n\nCan you draw Chapipi in an outfit / pose similar to the one referenced below? Feel free to use whatever colors and style you think would fit Chapipi the best!\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter References:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cz6MT87jRwLqZaC0_Xkww4AEprY8AIx1\n\nPose / Outfit Reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1rSFwIQ048xfHYMVOL4NIV1x3-KL1aGmh/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ZukeMacha/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f88b9b5/uploads/origins/f41df4af-7177-4459-aeb2-ac425b16476b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b29e621e282bafe221066b4348abd421", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f88b9b5/uploads/origins/f41df4af-7177-4459-aeb2-ac425b16476b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b29e621e282bafe221066b4348abd421, https://si.imgix.net/5f88b9b5/uploads/origins/f41df4af-7177-4459-aeb2-ac425b16476b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fae29c0ebeb4f2b32992d89ab8ae78dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5f88b9b5/uploads/origins/f41df4af-7177-4459-aeb2-ac425b16476b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13a987c7648ab2561550b5919169174d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。次のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ciSfIjdGYp